SUMMARY:📋 FOLLOW UP: Lyft Developer Account Approval Status
DESCRIPTION:Follow up on Lyft Healthcare / Lyft Concierge developer account approval.\n\n1. Check email for approval notification\n2. If not approved: email developers@lyft.com referencing your application\n3. Once approved: go to https://www.lyft.com/developers → get Client ID + Secret\n4. Add to NEXUS .env: LYFT_HEALTHCARE_CLIENT_ID and LYFT_HEALTHCARE_CLIENT_SECRET\n5. Test: GET /prism/lyft-healthcare/status → should show configured: true\n\nDashboard (once active): https://concierge.lyft.com\nContact: developers@lyft.com\n\nWhy it matters: Lyft WAV is DDIs only wheelchair (A0130) NEMT dispatch path.\nUber Health handles ambulatory. Lyft handles wheelchair. Both needed for full broker network coverage.
